      L4 fixed six of the seven rows it was aimed at, and <em>I still declined
      it</em>. Outside its target it broke more than it fixed. That was the
      repo&rsquo;s first statistically significant harm. Two of the four levels
      shipped a &ldquo;no,&rdquo; and I wrote each one down before I built it.
